    "titleText": {
      "es": "Bueno, *yo* creo que soy real. Mírame. Mira mi cara. Si me cortas, sangro. ¿Qué más quieres? Por favor, no te vayas.",
      "en": "Well, *I* think I'm real. Look at me. Look at my face. Cut me and I'll bleed. What more do you want? Please don't go.",
      "noteEn": "The title text lets the figure in the dream argue that it is real, extending the nightmare's emotional manipulation beyond the panel."
    },
